  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DAN 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila ami mumwaka wakusambila wanowu kaMediya Dariyusa, nemeni nakumukwashaku nakumukolesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichi dinu nukukuleja nsaŋu yalala. Tiya, muPeresi mwakemana anyanta amakwawu asatu; wamuchiwana wakabadika akwawu ejima kuheta. Chakelayi nakwati dehi Ŋovu namahetindi, wakayisaŋumuna wejima wawu ayi nakulwa netuŋa dawaHeleni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwakanyamuka lumwanta lwasweja Ŋovu, wakayula nawanta weneni, wakela mwaya muchima windi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chakemanayi, wanta windi wakakotoka, akawubalula chakutalisha kumpepela jamwiwulu jiwana; ilaŋa hiyakawubalwila anyanindi, hela mwaya kuyula kwindi kwayuliliyuku; wanta windi akawubwita, wakekala wawantu acheŋi akulunjika kudawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta wakukabeta kakuchimunswa wakekala naŋovu, nikalamba kindi wumu; yena wakekala naŋovu jakumubadika, wakekala nawanta wakuyula, wanta windi owu wakekala wanta weneni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwakakumina nyaka akadibomba; mwana kamwanta wakukabeta kakuchidiilu wamumbanda wakaya kudi mwanta wakukabeta kakuchimunswa nakutiyaloŋana nindi; ilaŋa yena mumbanda hakalama Ŋovu yachikasa chinduku; hela iyala niyena hakemanaku, hela chikasa chindi; ilaŋa yena mumbanda akamuhana, ninawa amuleteli, niiyala wamuvweli, niiyala wamwinkeli Ŋovu yena nyakoyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa kumutombu wakafuma kunyiji yindi kwakemana wumu, wakahiŋaa mwayena, wakenza kwizaza danjita, wakeŋa ila mumpwembu yamwanta wakukabeta kakuchimunswa, wakayikoŋa, wakayiimika mushindu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakanona akishi awu, ninkishi jawu jamawumba, niyuma yawu yasiliva nawuru yayiwahi, wakayitwala muEjipitu muwukoli. Nyaka yantesha wakaleka kuya nakulwa namwanta wakukabeta kakuchimunswa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena wakeŋa ila mwituŋa damwanta wakukabeta kakuchidiilu. Ilaŋa yena wakafunta cheŋi mwituŋa dindi yomweni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyanindi amayala akabutula njita, akapompesha luntu lwayendu yamaneni, akenzana ho-o, akasumpoka nikusumpoka, akahitamu. Akafunta cheŋi, akaasaŋa njita ndo nikumpwembu yindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta wakukabeta kakuchidiilu, kumuchima windi kwakamukuma nakuzuwa, wakedika nakulwa nindi, nayenowu mwanta wakukabeta kakuchimunswa. Wakatandamisha Iuntu lwaluvulu, luntu olu akaluhana kudi yena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chakelayi natwali dehi luntu olu, muchima windi wakadinyamuna kwiwulu; wakadimbwisha makumi amakombakaji heseki, hela chochu, hakemika mushinduku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta wakukabeta kakuchimunswa wakafunta, wakatandamisha luntu lwaluvulu lwakubadika lwakusambila, wakenzaŋa ho-o hakakumina mpinji, yonyaka, wakenza nanjita yeneni, namaheta amavulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hampinji oju amavulu akemana nakulwa namwanta wakukabeta kakuchidiilu; akwandombu akumuza wenu nawa akadinyamuna kwiwulu kulonda akoleshi chimwenu ochu; Ilaŋa wena akadimbuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi mwanta wakukabeta kakuchimunswa wakenza, wakadima mpwembu, wakatambula mukala wadihata naŋovu. Yitwa yakukabeta kakuchidiilu hiyakadikaŋaku, hela muza windi watondayi, hikwakekala hela Ŋovu yakudikaŋa nihantuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa yena wakenza nakulwa nindi, wakela mwaya muchima windi hohu, kwosi wakemana kumesu induku. Wakemana mwituŋa dalubanji, muchikasa chindi mwakekala jakujilumuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakatalisha mesu indi chakwinza naŋovu yawanta windi wejima, wakenza namazu akutiyaloŋana nawakwakwoloka hamu nayena, wakela mwakeŋa ayi. Akamwinka mwana wamumbanda wakudi ambanda kulonda amutamishi; ilaŋa yena mumbanda hakemana hela kwikala wakumukwasha yenaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulondela henohu wakatalisha mesu indi kuyitutu, wakatambula yayivulu. Ilaŋa kalamba wumu wakakumisha kusawula kwasawilaŋayi, mwalala, wakabalumuna kusawula kwasawilaŋayi kumubalumukili yomweni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henohu wakatalisha mesu indi kumpwembu jakuhata mwituŋa dindi yomweni; ilaŋa yena wakahukana, wakadimbuka, hakamwekana nawa cheŋuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mudi yena wuwabulili kwiluka muntu wakahitisha mukwakudya nyilambu mulubanji lwetuŋa; ilaŋa chimwakahita mafuku antesha akamukotola, hichakuzuwa indi kwiji chanjitaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mudi yena nawa mwakahina muntu wasekeshewa, abulili kwinkawu kulema kwetuŋa; ilaŋa wakenza mumwaka wakashakamawu antu chachiwahi, wakatambula ituŋa namazu akulambisha akwawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akayikumpula kumesu indi nayitwa yadibaji, akakotoka; eŋa, nikalamba kachitiyaŋenu nawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulondela hakukana kwadikaninuwu nayena wakakoŋa mwakudimbana; muloŋa yena wakenza nakukanduka, wakakwata Ŋovu namuza wanyanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamwaka wakushakama chachiwahi wakenza hayipela yamuwuloŋu yasweja manji, wakela mwabulahu dehi kwila ankakulula jindi, hela ankakulula jawankakulula jindi; wakayimwaŋila mwaŋila niyanakwatuwu, niyanapupuwu, nimaheta. Eŋa, wakafuukula yifuukula yindi yakulwa nampwembu jakola, mwakahita mpinji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakasaŋumuna Ŋovu jindi nawulobu windi wakuya nakulwa namwanta wakukabeta kakuchidiilu nanjita yeneni. Mwanta wakukabeta kakuchidiilu waka asa njita nanjita yindi yeneni nankashi yasweja Ŋovu. Hela chochu, hakemanaku, muloŋa akamufuukwila yifuukula yatama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eŋa, akadya yakudya yindi diwu akamukotola, ninjita yindi yakasumpoka; amavulu akadimboka afwa dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila wenawa anyanta ayedi nyichima yawu yakaya mukwila chatama, akahosha yuma yakutwamba kumesa yawu yimu. Ilaŋa hichakalu mbulukaku; hela chochu, kukuma kwakenza hampinji yakutoŋola dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henohu wakafunta mwituŋa dindi namaheta amavulu; muchima windi hiwakakeŋa chitiyaŋenu chajilaku; wakakoŋa mwakeŋa ayi, wakafunta kwituŋa dindi yomweni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hampinji yakutoŋola dehi wakafunta, wakenza kukabeta kakuchidiilu; ilaŋa hakukuminina hichakekala neyi hakusambilaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa maatu akuKitimi amaneni akenza nakulwa nayena; dichi yena wakatiya chikela, wakafunta cheŋi, wakazuwa nankashi nachitiyaŋenu chajila, wakakoŋa mwakeŋa ayi. Mwalala wakafunta, wakakwata mpùŋa nanawa akaleka chitiyaŋenu chajila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumutamba windi yena kwakemana yitwa, yakajilola malala, yoyi mpwembu yakuhata, yakafumisha himulambu wakushita wahefuku hefuku, yakashamu chishimashima chaleteshaŋa mahembi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awa akumotoka chitiyaŋenu wakayitamisha namazu akulambisha. Hakwila antu eluka Nzambi yawu akakola ngu, akakoŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awa ahadi antu akweti maana akaleja akwawu amavulu. Hela chochu, akadimbuka kumpoku yakabali, nikumulaŋu wakesi, nikuwukoli, nikukuyipupa, mafuku amavulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chakadimbukawu akayikwasha kukwasha kwantesha; ilaŋa ntu amavulu akadibomba nawu namazu akulambisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amakwawu akweti maana akadimbuka, kulonda kuyikosa, nikuyitookesha akatooki to-o, ndo nikumpinji yakukuminina; muloŋa chumichi chichidi chakumpinji yakutoŋola dehi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta wakela mwakeŋa a muchima windi. Wakaditwala kwiwulu, wakaditohesha chakudibadisha hadi amaneni ejima, wakahosha yuma yakuhayama yakudiwula Nzambi yawanzambi. Wakaluŋa nichakawanishawu kuzuwa. Muloŋa chuma chatoŋolawu dehi akachikoŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakasha muchima kudi Nzambi yawankakulula jindi, hela kukukeŋamba nda, hela kukubaŋa mukishuku; wakaditohesha chakudibadisha hadi ejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakalemeshaŋa mukishi wampwembu jakuhata; mukishi abulili kwilukawu ankakulula jindi diyi akalemeshayi yena nawuru, nasiliva, natumalola twalema wuseya, nayuma yayiwahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpwembu jakuhata jasweja Ŋovu wakajikoŋa naŋovu jamukishi wakwacheŋi, akamwitŋa wakayitohesha nakulema. Wakayinka wanta wakuyula antu amavulu, wakabalula balula ituŋa muwuseya muwuseya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hampinji yakukuminina mwanta wakukabeta kakuchidiilu wakamulotokela nanjita; mwanta wakukabeta kakuchimunswa wakenza nakulwa nindi neyi chinjimbi, namakálu, nawantu akwendela hatuwalu, namaatu amaneni amavulu. Wakeŋila mumatuŋa, wakasumpoka, ahita nikuhita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakeŋila nawa mwituŋa dalubanji, akashenkumuna matuŋa amavulu; tiyenu akapuluka kudi yena, Edomi, naMowabi, nachibalu chawanyana kaAmoni cheneni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakolola makasindi hamatuŋa; niituŋa daEjipitu hidakapulukaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakekala nawanta wakuyula yuma yalema yawuru nasiliva, niyuma yamuEjipitu yalema; aLibiya nawaEtiyopiya akamulondelaŋa muchendu chindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa nsaŋu jakumusela nŋakukabeta kakuchimunswa jakamwakamisha; wakaya nakulendumuka nindi akakisaŋani, akajilumuni chikupu antu amavulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakalema matenti indi amaneni awanta kuneli kaluŋalwiji iku, mpidi yalubanji yajila iku, yena hakachi; ilaŋa jakamukuma, kwosi niniwu wakamukwashaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
